{"id": "139769", "name": "הרחבה לבסיס - פולינומים", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "(", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "vectToPoly", "params": ["vect"], "body": "sum(vect[i+1][1]*x^i,i,0,length(vect)-1)"}, {"name": "polyToVect", "params": ["poly"], "body": "transpose(rest(coeff_list(x^4+poly,x),-1))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונים הפולינומים ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}_{\\leq 3}[x]\\)</span>:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(p_1={{CT:0}}\\),</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(p_2={{CT:1}}\\)</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>מצאו פולינומים נוספים <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(p_3,p_4\\in\\mathbb{R}_{\\leq 3}[x]\\)</span> כך שהקבוצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(S=\\{p_1,p_2,p_3,p_4\\}\\)</span> תהווה בסיס ל-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{R}_{\\leq 3}[x]\\)</span>.</p><p>נסמן</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\(p_3(x)=a_3+b_3x+c_3x^2+d_3x^3,\\quad p_4(x)=a_4+b_4x+c_4x^2+d_4x^3\\)</p><p>מצאו מקדמים מתאימים (הזינו אותם כרשימה בתוך סוגרים <code dir=\"ltr\">[]</code>):</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\([a_3, b_3, c_3, d_3]= \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-list\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: הרכיבים בסוגריים מרובעים, מופרדים בפסיקים. למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">[1,-2,3]</code>.</p><div style=\"margin-top:10px\"></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\([a_4, b_4, c_4, d_4]= \\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:prt1]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 25, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "[?,?,?,?]", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 25, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "[?,?,?,?]", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "matVecsWithS: addcol(matVecs, transpose(ans1),transpose(ans2));\nflag: is(rank(matVecsWithS)=n);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "flag", "tans": "true", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובה נכונה</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">תשובה שגויה</div>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["Id", "eco", "idxs", "k", "matVecs", "matVecsWI", "n", "polyvecs", "v3", "v4", "vecNum", "vecs"], "nvariants": 50}